00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:17.449
So-- So-- So--
So, what else did y'all say?

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.918
(LAUGHING)

00:00:20.319 --> 00:00:21.754
I thought it was just gonna be
the two of us.

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:22.855
